# Learning

## After adding a feature

Run `.cursor/skills/learn/SKILL.md` to capture what was learned.
Append an entry to `.cursor/skills/add-feature-web/learned/README.md`.

## Gated learning

- Modifying core files (`src/api/`, `src/stores/`, `src/app/`, `src/layouts/`) requires
  checking `learned/README.md` for prior lessons first.
- If a lesson covers the area you're changing, apply it or explicitly note why not.

## Learned index

`.cursor/skills/add-feature-web/learned/README.md` is the index.
Format per entry:

```
## YYYY-MM-DD — <Feature Name>

**Pattern:** <one-line description>
**Files touched:** list
**Key decisions:** bullet list
**Pitfalls:** bullet list
```
